2026-11-06T03:13:42.7657280Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
2026-11-06T03:13:42.7657586Z  - install Nix in /nix
2026-11-06T03:13:42.7657852Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
2026-11-06T03:13:42.7658200Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
2026-11-06T03:13:42.7658522Z    /root
2026-11-06T03:13:42.7668067Z  - back up /etc/bash.bashrc to /etc/bash.bashrc.backup-before-nix
2026-11-06T03:13:42.7668528Z  - update /etc/bash.bashrc to include some Nix configuration
2026-11-06T03:13:42.7678737Z  - load and start a service (at /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.service
2026-11-06T03:13:42.7679162Z    and /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.socket) for nix-daemon
2026-11-06T03:13:42.7679430Z 
